{"name": "Slap 'em UP!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"238\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/f5efbe4420ff8e9f71187f7695128030.poster.avif?t=1787656053\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/f5efbe4420ff8e9f71187f7695128030.webm?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/f5efbe4420ff8e9f71187f7695128030.mp4?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Get in on the casual party card game where every hand is a chance to roast your friends! Slap them down with the higher cards, blast them with mocking stickers, or drop emotes they won\u2019t forget. Dress to impress and make your way to the crown. Who\u2019s the real king now?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Easy rules, anyone can play, instant fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A well-known classic card game, with simple rules you can understand in just a few minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just play your cards at the right moment, and you could be the winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/042969243c3950cdd8c390a9e768df14.poster.avif?t=1787656053\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/042969243c3950cdd8c390a9e768df14.webm?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/042969243c3950cdd8c390a9e768df14.mp4?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Let loose with emojis &amp; hilarious stickers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mock your opponents with funny cutscenes during epic moments \u2014 whether it\u2019s a win or a surprise comeback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush them with hilarious emojis or throw in a cheeky sticker to seal the deal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"344\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/ffd13912050c9b3a5aa9b3392194d136.poster.avif?t=1787656053\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/ffd13912050c9b3a5aa9b3392194d136.webm?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/ffd13912050c9b3a5aa9b3392194d136.mp4?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Play in various modes, either with random players or your group of friends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy both global matchmaking and private rooms for fun with up to 4 friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for both serious players and those looking to chill with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"452\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/e636146f6a4b8ac75f28e29861a3007e.poster.avif?t=1787656053\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/e636146f6a4b8ac75f28e29861a3007e.webm?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/e636146f6a4b8ac75f28e29861a3007e.mp4?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/69dc0ae83ea25b31cb67671edfdb0e24.poster.avif?t=1787656053\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/69dc0ae83ea25b31cb67671edfdb0e24.webm?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/69dc0ae83ea25b31cb67671edfdb0e24.mp4?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make it yours, make it epic.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize cards, characters, and effects to create your own iconic look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every match feels fresh when it's in your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"448\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/f2c338108aae2991988bcee7adb5d7e8.poster.avif?t=1787656053\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/f2c338108aae2991988bcee7adb5d7e8.webm?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/extras/f2c338108aae2991988bcee7adb5d7e8.mp4?t=1787656053\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Get in on the casual party card game where every hand is a chance to roast your friends! Slap them down with the higher cards, blast them with mocking stickers, or drop emotes they won\u2019t forget. Dress to impress and make your way to the crown. Who\u2019s the real king now?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703520/bf682b6b4543d40495b96fa28d2f9610de3bbd91/header.jpg?t=1787656053", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Card Game", "Multiplayer", "Tabletop", "Strategy", "Board Game"], "developers": "Urnique Studio", "publishers": "Urnique Studio", "release_date": "Nov 3, 2025", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "3703520", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "13 May 2025 - Demo\n\n3 November 2025 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ezurU2zW9ss", "first_seen": 1747087200.0, "review_rank": 1669}